OL,3,CResidents evacuated as major wildfire
OL,4,Ccontinues to burn near Llandovery
OL,6,FA number of residents have been
OL,7,Fevacuated due to wildfires in Porth
OL,8,Fand near Llandovery - where a major
OL,9,Fincident has been declared.
OL,11,FPeople are being advised to avoid both
OL,12,Fareas and keep windows and doors shut
OL,13,Fto smoke.
OL,15,FRest centres were set up at Llandovery
OL,16,FLeisure Centre and at Rhondda Fach
OL,17,FLeisure Centre for local people
OL,18,Fimpacted by the fires.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G1/7
