OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F431A1786798093
OL,3,CResidents evacuated as major wildfire
OL,4,Ccontinues to burn near Llandovery
OL,6,FCrews across the country continue to
OL,7,Fdeal with a number of blazes, with
OL,8,FSouth Wales Fire and Rescue Service
OL,9,Fresponding to more than 30 fires on
OL,10,FThursday (13 August).
OL,12,FOn Wednesday, Greater Manchester Fire
OL,13,Fand Rescue Service sent three crews to
OL,14,Fsupport teams in south Wales dealing
OL,15,Fwith ongoing wildfires.
OL,17,FFirefighters have been attempting to
OL,18,Fbring the flames under control in the
OL,19,FRhandirmwyn area, near Llandovery,
OL,20,Fsince around 12:45 on Wednesday (12
OL,21,FAugust).
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G2/7
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
