PN,43103
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F431A1786798093
OL,3,CResidents evacuated as major wildfire
OL,4,Ccontinues to burn near Llandovery
OL,6,FOn Thursday, Mid and West Wales Fire
OL,7,Fand Rescue Service said because of the
OL,8,F"scale, complexity and potential
OL,9,Fimpact of the wildfire", it was
OL,10,Fdeclaring a "major incident". At that
OL,11,Fpoint, the fire covered an area of
OL,12,Faround 250 hectares - equivalent to
OL,13,Fabout 350 football pitches in size.
OL,15,FA number of residential properties
OL,16,Fhave been evacuated as a precaution
OL,17,Fbecause of the fire's close proximity.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G3/7
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BWales News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,432,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43104
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F431A1786798093
OL,3,CResidents evacuated as major wildfire
OL,4,Ccontinues to burn near Llandovery
OL,6,FThe fire service encouraged residents
OL,7,Fto use the rest centre established by
OL,8,FCarmarthenshire County Council and
OL,9,Ffollow safety advice.
OL,11,FIt added: "Members of the public are
OL,12,Fasked to avoid the area and not to fly
OL,13,Fdrones near the incident, allowing
OL,14,Femergency services to operate safely
OL,15,Fand effectively."
OL,17,FThe south Wales service said the high
OL,18,Ftemperatures, changing wind and
OL,19,Fchallenging terrain are continuing to
OL,20,Fmake firefighting conditions difficult.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G4/7
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
