PN,43105
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F431A1786798093
OL,3,CResidents evacuated as major wildfire
OL,4,Ccontinues to burn near Llandovery
OL,6,FDeputy Chief Fire Officer for South
OL,7,FWales Fire and Rescue Service, Adam
OL,8,FOpenshaw, said: "Our firefighters have
OL,9,Fbeen working tirelessly over a
OL,10,Fprolonged period of intense wildfire
OL,11,Factivity and continue to respond to
OL,12,Fmultiple incidents across South Wales
OL,13,Fand Gwent.
OL,15,F"We are strengthening our resilience
OL,16,Farrangements and seeking additional
OL,17,Fsupport from partner organisations and
OL,18,Fneighbouring services to help us
OL,19,Fprotect communities and support our
OL,20,Fcrews during this sustained period of
OL,21,Fdemand.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G5/7
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BWales News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,432,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43106
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F431A1786798093
OL,3,CResidents evacuated as major wildfire
OL,4,Ccontinues to burn near Llandovery
OL,6,F"These conditions are creating an
OL,7,Fextremely high risk of fire spread,
OL,8,Fand our resources remain under
OL,9,Fsignificant pressure. We are grateful
OL,10,Ffor the continued support and hard
OL,11,Fwork of our crews and colleagues,
OL,12,Fpartner agencies, fire and rescue
OL,13,Fservices from across the UK, local
OL,14,Fcommunities and everyone who is
OL,15,Fhelping to keep people safe.
OL,17,F"We are asking the public to play
OL,18,Ftheir part by avoiding activities that
OL,19,Fcould start fires and by reporting any
OL,20,Fsigns of new wildfires where property
OL,21,Fis at risk on 999.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G6/7
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BWales News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,432,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43107
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F431A1786798093
OL,3,CResidents evacuated as major wildfire
OL,4,Ccontinues to burn near Llandovery
OL,6,F"Our colleagues in Control are dealing
OL,7,Fwith numerous calls about smoke in the
OL,8,Farea and we have instigated additional
OL,9,Fsupport to deal with the volume of
OL,10,Fcalls we are receiving. Please be
OL,11,Fassured that we are aware of these
OL,12,Fincidents and have crews responding
OL,13,Fwhere required."
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G7/7
